  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Sustainable Agro-Forestry (PSAF) (2017-2021) between Timor-Leste, the European Union (EU) and Germany (BMZ)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to contribute to a peaceful, inclusive and sustainable development in Timor-Leste through improved rural access, the creation of employment, economic and domestic revenue opportunities, and a durable reduction in food insecurity and malnutrition in rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
